# Environment variables — never commit these. The specific patterns below
# predate this catch-all and are kept for clarity, but .env* is what actually
# covers every variant (.env.test, .env.staging, .env.ci, ...) — only the
# example files are meant to be tracked.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production
.env.development
.env*
!.env.example
!ops/.env.example

